# Admin app (`@pakfactory/admin`)

Follow [`apps/admin/AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md), [`AGENTS.md`](../../../../AGENTS.md), [`DESIGN.md`](../../../../DESIGN.md) (UI).

**Quick rules:**

- **Scope:** staff sign-in + read-only buyer requests (PROD-2405) — not Studio or www marketing.
- **PR base:** `www-new-release`.
- **Data:** real Supabase auth; mock reads until PROD-2414/2415 (`ADMIN_DATA_SOURCE=mock`).
- **Dev bypass:** `ADMIN_DEV_BYPASS` — local only, never production/shared preview.
- **Packages:** domain / supabase / auth-ui / ui — no Sanity.
- **Local:** `pnpm dev:admin` → **4000**; cookie collisions with www on localhost — see admin AGENTS troubleshooting.
